    <body dur="4:13.905">
        <div begin="26.663" end="46.202" itunes:songPart="Verse">
            <p begin="26.663" end="31.477" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1">說不上為什麼 我變得很主動<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">说不上为什么 我变得很主动</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="zh-Latn-pinyin">shuo bu shang wei shen me wo bian de hen zhu dong</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="31.673" end="36.245" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1">若愛上一個人 什麼都會值得去做<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若爱上一个人 什么都会值得去做</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="zh-Latn-pinyin">ruo ai shang yi ge ren shen me du hui zhi de qu zuo</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="36.622" end="41.280" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1">我想大聲宣佈 對妳依依不捨<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想大声宣布 对你依依不舍</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="zh-Latn-pinyin">wo xiang da sheng xuan bu dui ni yi yi bu she</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="41.541" end="46.202" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1">連隔壁鄰居都 猜到我現在的感受<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">连隔壁邻居都 猜到我现在的感受</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="zh-Latn-pinyin">lian ge bi lin ju dou cai dao wo xian zai de gan shou</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div begin="46.495" end="1:06.128" itunes:songPart="Verse">
            <p begin="46.495" end="51.272" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1">河邊的風在吹著頭髮 飄動<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">河边的风在吹着头发 飘动</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="zh-Latn-pinyin">he bian de feng zai chui zhe tou fa piao dong</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="51.472" end="56.200" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1">牽著妳的手一陣莫名感動<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">牵着你的手一阵莫名感动</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="zh-Latn-pinyin">qian zhe ni de shou yi zhen mo ming gan dong</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="56.396" end="1:00.192" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1">我想帶妳回我的外婆家<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想带你回我的外婆家</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="zh-Latn-pinyin">wo xiang dai ni hui wo de wai po jia</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:00.196" end="1:06.128" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1">一起看著日落 一直到我們都睡著<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">一起看着日落 一直到我们都睡着</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="zh-Latn-pinyin">yi qi kan zhe ri luo yi zhi dao wo men dou shui zhao</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div begin="1:06.350" end="1:25.739" itunes:songPart="Chorus">
            <p begin="1:06.350" end="1:10.943" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1">我想就這樣牽著妳的手不放開<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想就这样牵着你的手不放开</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="zh-Latn-pinyin">wo xiang jiu zhe yang qian zhe ni de shou bu fang kai</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:11.278" end="1:15.908" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1">愛能不能夠永遠單純沒有悲哀<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱能不能够永远单纯没有悲哀</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="zh-Latn-pinyin">ai neng bu neng gou yong yuan dan chun mei you bei ai</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:15.894" end="1:20.898" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1">我想帶妳騎單車 我想和妳看棒球<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想带你骑单车 我想和你看棒球</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="zh-Latn-pinyin">wo xiang dai ni qi dan che wo xiang he ni kan bang qiu</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:21.397" end="1:25.739" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1">想這樣沒擔憂唱著歌一直走<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想这样没担忧唱着歌一直走</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="zh-Latn-pinyin">xiang zhe yang mei dan you chang zhe ge yi zhi zou</span>
            </p>
        </div>
        <div begin="1:26.116" end="1:45.480" itunes:songPart="Chorus">
            <p begin="1:26.116" end="1:30.754" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1">我想就這樣牽著妳的手不放開<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想就这样牵着你的手不放开</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="zh-Latn-pinyin">wo xiang jiu zhe yang qian zhe ni de shou bu fang kai</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:31.030" end="1:35.666" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1">愛可不可以簡簡單單沒有傷害<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">爱可不可以简简单单没有伤害</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="zh-Latn-pinyin">ai ke bu ke yi jian jian dan dan mei you shang hai</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:35.737" end="1:40.683" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1">妳靠著我的肩膀 妳在我胸口睡著<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你靠着我的肩膀 你在我胸口睡着</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="zh-Latn-pinyin">ni kao zhe wo de jian bang ni zai wo xiong kou shui zhao</span>
            </p>
            <p begin="1:41.188" end="1:45.480" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1">像這樣的生活 我愛妳 妳愛我<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">像这样的生活 我爱你 你爱我</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="zh-Latn-pinyin">xiang zhe yang de sheng huo wo ai ni ni ai wo</span>
            </p>
        </div>
