            <p begin="1:45.532" end="1:52.802" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1">想 簡簡單單愛<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">想 简简单单爱</span>
                <span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="zh-Latn-pinyin">xiang jian jian dan dan ai</span>
            </p>
